// A motor court: a row of rooms at the back of the lot facing a kidney-shaped pool behind a
// low wall, an office by the drive, a tall sign with a neon arrow pointing in. Grounded; C is
// its kitsch take. Kit format: crates/world/src/landmarks.rs and
// docs/adr/0007-landmark-kits.md. Kit frame, m: x across the lot (to the right seen from the
// road), y up, z toward the road; the lot spans x -30..30 and z -40..0.
Kit(
    id: "motel",
    about: "A motor court: rooms round a kidney pool behind a low wall and a sign with a neon arrow.",
    tone: Grounded,
    lot: (60.0, 40.0),
    ground: Some("pad"),
    paints: [
        ("pad", (color: Pal(Asphalt), surface: Asphalt)),
        ("stripe", (color: Pal(PaintWhite), surface: Paint)),
        ("wall", (color: Pal(StuccoCream), surface: Stucco)),
        ("cap", (color: Pal(StuccoWhite), surface: Stucco)),
        ("roof", (color: Pal(RoofGravel), surface: RoofGravel)),
        ("door", (color: Pal(Teal), surface: Paint)),
        ("glass", (color: Pal(Glass), surface: Glass, glow: Some((Pal(WindowWarm), Window)))),
        ("rail", (color: Pal(MetalLight), surface: Metal)),
        ("deck", (color: Pal(Concrete), surface: Concrete)),
        ("coping", (color: Pal(StuccoWhite), surface: Concrete)),
        ("water", (color: Srgb(0x3FB8D8), surface: Glass, glow: Some((Srgb(0x3FD2F0), Lamp)))),
        ("chair", (color: Pal(PaintWhite), surface: Paint)),
        ("umbrella", (color: Srgb(0xE8714A), surface: Awning)),
        ("pole", (color: Pal(MetalDark), surface: Metal)),
        ("sign", (color: Srgb(0x2E7FA8), surface: Paint)),
        ("signface", (color: Srgb(0xF4ECDA), glow: Some((Srgb(0xFFF1D6), Neon)))),
